==Trivia==
*The name is a play on "{{Wp|Watt#Kilowatt|kilowatt}}", a unit of power, with the word "killer" included to imply their hostility, or that they may give a deadly amount of watts.
*During [[Enlightened Journey]], and while unlocking routes for the [[Balloon transport system]], some killerwatts can be seen standing on top of clouds, trees, rocks and buildings. Despite this, they cannot be fought anywhere outside of the killerwatt plane.
** Additionally, a [[Caged Killerwatt]] can be found in the sewers of [[Zemouregal's Base]].

